{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":81037,"Title":"liked a post you made in Reception Ideas","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI was reading an article somewhere that suggested setting up games to play, such as croquet, giant jenga, hopscotch, etc. Some of these would require renting equipment and some may not be suitable at night, but maybe it gives you some other ideas.\n \nWhat about a photobooth? Yo...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79083-reception-ideas\/?view=findpost&p=1893500\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429345508,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80976,"Title":"liked a post you made in Reception Ideas","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI was reading an article somewhere that suggested setting up games to play, such as croquet, giant jenga, hopscotch, etc. Some of these would require renting equipment and some may not be suitable at night, but maybe it gives you some other ideas.\n \nWhat about a photobooth? Yo...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79083-reception-ideas\/?view=findpost&p=1893500\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429295086,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80938,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that deecol mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79042-cost-for-guests\/?view=findpost&p=1893486\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"vancouverpetunia\"  For sure!  Thanks!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1427826222","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429266125,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80872,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that snswedding2016 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79074-does-number-of-guests-matter-for-all-inclusive\/?view=findpost&p=1893451\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Ruzanna\" I agree with what all the ladies have said so far. It really depends on the resort and package you choose. My fianc\u00e9 and I were budgeting for 60 people when we first started planning our DW. I was very frustrated that a lot of the places we liked only had packages for groups up to 25-30 people. Like @\"vancouverpetunia\" said the additional person charges ranged from $80+ per person (in the ones we researched anyway). I thought that was really crazy especially when we were expected double the amount of people those packages are built for. Plus for us a lot of what was included in those packages weren't necessary for us. I can see them working really well if you have a smaller group and you want things like a champagne toast. My cousin had a DW 2 years ago that they only had 30 people and so all the packages fit perfectly for them. The price was sky rocketing as we started pricing it out\u2026then we found the Karisma properties. While they do over charge for A LOT of other things (flowers, outside vendor fees etc) we found that building our wedding a la carte worked much better for our group size and ended up saving us money compared to the initial packages we researched.\n \nWe were trying to keep our ceremony & reception to $6000 or less and that seemed impossible with a group of 60 at a resort like the Barcelo properties. Keep in mind we wanted a private reception and the only location stipulation was that it wasn't in a hall\/ballroom. At Azul Fives (the property we ended up choosing) so far we're at $4100 with our guest count being at 53 - this includes ceremony, private reception, partial decor, food, open bar, sound system (we opted not to have a DJ) and an outside vendor fee (for our photographer). With photography we're at $5200 - so far staying within our budget. It also comes with a couple of other perks that weren't a necessity for us but are a nice bonus like wifi (for the bride and groom), a groom's room to get ready (with gourmet bites), 2 for 1 massages, 15% discount at the spa, honeymoon breakfast in bed, candlelit dinner for 2 on the beach and a couple of other small things. Azul Fives is a great fit for us but may not be for others. Take your time to really look into all your options and find the resort that best suits your needs!\n \nI hope that helps a bit! Happy planning! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429242121,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80857,"Title":"liked a post you made in Does Number Of Guests Matte...","Message":"Hello!\n\nRuzanna just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nYup. It's annoying. I asked myself the same question: If my guests are all paying for all-inclusive food & drink, why does it cost so much more for the wedding dinner. I do get it to an extent. It's outside of the regular service they are providing both at your event and behind the scenes...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79074-does-number-of-guests-matter-for-all-inclusive\/?view=findpost&p=1893425\n","Sender":{"Id":281803,"Name":"Ruzanna","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429217602,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80856,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Ruzanna mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79074-does-number-of-guests-matter-for-all-inclusive\/?view=findpost&p=1893447\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nYup. It's annoying. I asked myself the same question: If my guests are all paying for all-inclusive food & drink, why does it cost so much more for the wedding dinner. I do get it to an extent. It's outside of the regular service they are providing both at your event and behind the scenes in the kitchen. They have to staff for it. But they are still making lots of $$$ off us!\n \nOur package is $3300 for 25 people (and includes a lot of extras - flowers, photography, videography, makeup\/hair, massage for 2, private dinner for 2 on the beach, soloist, etc.). Then it's $94 per additional person for dinner. This includes set-up, champagne toast, wedding cake, cocktail hour, etc. But these are also priced separately so, for example, I don't plan to add any extra wedding cake. We get a cake for 25 plus dessert, so that will save me $7 per extra person. Oh, BTW, this doesn't include the $5 per extra chair for the wedding ceremony! And, if we want our reception to go past 9, we have to pay $15\/person per hour for EVERYONE. Don't get me started on sound systems, etc. \n \nI'm sad to say that DWs are a nickle & dime experience.  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/unsure.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':unsure:' \/>\n-----------------------------\n\n \n@\"vancouverpetunia\"  I'm glad i'm not the only one who didn't get the whole additional pay concept. BUT $94 PP is Toronto prices!!! I can't believe they would charge you that much! Where are planning your wedding?\n \n@\"beckys98\" $20pp additional is what i saw for some resorts. That sounds more reasonable.  I guess I would have to turn on some mad negotiation skills HAHA\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281803,"Name":"Ruzanna","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429217562,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80845,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vancouverpetunia - Now Sapp...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"Wafflesmom\" data-cid=\"1893297\" data-time=\"1429155558\">@  I love your story! It's so cute that a destination wedding got the two of you together! And I love how you said thank you instead of yes, that's do Canadian of you lolYou picked a gr...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1893306\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429217064,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80806,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77507-cost-for-photographer-in-cancun\/?view=findpost&p=1893427\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"vancouverpetunia\" We are using Lancelotti Photography <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> and Juan Carlo Lancelotti is sooo nice and has been so great with everything. I heard great feedback about him from another Toronto bride that used him for her DW. \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429207702,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80805,"Title":"liked a post you made in Cost For Photographer In Ca...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  Who was the photographer you used with Adventure Photo, in case we end up going that route? Did you add onto your photography package or did you just get the one that came with your package?\n \n@  Which photographer are you using? That sounds like a good rate! \n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77507-cost-for-photographer-in-cancun\/?view=findpost&p=1893426\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429207625,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80632,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Meandhim mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1893341\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"vancouverpetunia\"\n \nWoohoo another planning thread to follow! I love seeing other peoples ideas. The story how you met is so cute!\n \nMost people won't book til the last day...and sometimes you will get just a handful more who book after that so don't worry.\n \nCant wait to see some of your ideas <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429173533,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80629,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vancouverpetunia - Now Sapp...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I'm sure you are not behind. Like I said, I'm a planner and this is my new obsession. I can't believe I already have flower ideas to send to the WC for a quote. LOL I'm a bit of a geek when it comes to this kind of stuff.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1893271\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429172925,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80625,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vancouverpetunia - Now Sapp...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLike so many other brides before me, it would seem, I wasn\u2019t going to do a planning thread. But I have seen how helpful they can be to others, as well as it\u2019s a great way to solicit ideas for yo...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1893268\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429172898,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80586,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77507-cost-for-photographer-in-cancun\/?view=findpost&p=1893327\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"vancouverpetunia\" Definitely a great resource. At the end of it all, my FI and I found a reasonably priced photographer with great work and we're paying $1200 for six hours of coverage + a $400 vendor fee.. ($1600 USD). We were originally going to ask someone attending our wedding who is a photographer, but then we felt like it was a bit unfair to ask that of a guest as we wanted them to enjoy the experience as any other guest would.\nIt ended up working out the same (cost wise) because we would've paid for their trip if we used them which would've costed $1700 CDN.\n \nJust something to think about, that's all!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429167815,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80585,"Title":"liked a post you made in Cost For Photographer In Ca...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nSo, based on this thread, I'm gathering that I'm looking at a cost of $1000 - $5000 (I assume USD) to hire a local photographer. One of our guests is a wedding photographer in Canada and I would love to have him shoot our wedding. What do you think is the best way to go about it? Ask him for a...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77507-cost-for-photographer-in-cancun\/?view=findpost&p=1893307\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429167672,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80563,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vancouverpetunia - Now Sapp...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLike so many other brides before me, it would seem, I wasn\u2019t going to do a planning thread. But I have seen how helpful they can be to others, as well as it\u2019s a great way to solicit ideas for yo...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1893268\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429163544,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80548,"Title":"liked a post you made in Now Sapphire Weddings Forme...","Message":"Hello!\n\njessiker05 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI've stayed at 2 resorts in the Mayakoba area of the RM, also a resort in Tulum and one near Puerto Aventuras. Their beaches all seemed fine to me. Now, I am not a beach person. I prefer pools. But since I'm not a beach person, I would not go in the water if it was \"icky\". I had no issues with...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/62152-now-sapphire-weddings-formerly-paradisus-riviera\/?view=findpost&p=1893269\n","Sender":{"Id":279800,"Name":"jessiker05","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429160765,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80522,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Wafflesmom mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1893297\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"vancouverpetunia\" I love your story! It's so cute that a destination wedding got the two of you together! And I love how you said thank you instead of yes, that's do Canadian of you  lol\n\nYou picked a great resort and it's great that your guests are so proactive with the deposits!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429130358,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80507,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vancouverpetunia - Now Sapp...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@ \n \nOh, that sounds like a perfect set up for summer in the Okanagan. Too bad it no longer works. Yes, he's from Delta and I lived in Langley when I was a young child, before moving to the Okanagan.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1893277\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429128872,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80506,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vancouverpetunia - Now Sapp...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I'm from Vernon. Lived there from grade 8 - 12 and my parents lived there for over 25 years. I do love visiting, I just wish I still had a free place to stay! Actually, if my parents still lived there I think we would have gotten married at their house. They had a beautiful place along a cl...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1893275\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429128808,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80503,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vancouverpetunia - Now Sapp...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nLike so many other brides before me, it would seem, I wasn\u2019t going to do a planning thread. But I have seen how helpful they can be to others, as well as it\u2019s a great way to solicit ideas for yo...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1893268\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429128663,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80484,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that calgarybride2015 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1893276\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"vancouverpetunia\"\n \nYes! this summer will be hard for us as we won't have a place to stay. Up until last year my husband shared in the expense to have a place there so we had somewhere to stay all summer!  Well the guy decided to move in with his girlfriend and we needed wedding money --- sooooo this summer should be interesting.    My sister's brother in law has a place over Okanagan Lake in Vernon so we are hoping we can stay there heheh!!!!       It is a beautiful area.\n \nWe did reminders as well, definitely at 2 weeks out, and then at 1 week out.  We even had people book after the deadline but our TA was able to secure them the same price. Thankfully most people booked in time!  We had 4 people book outside the group but that was ok!  We had more than enough book with us to get some of the freebie\/discounts!\n \nIs your fiance originally from the Vancouver area? I am actually from northern BC (born in Terrace but mainly lived in Fort. St. John) I have been in Calgary for 15 years though!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429125544,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80480,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vancouverpetunia - Now Sapp...","Message":"Hello!\n\nsnswedding2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I had missed your planning thread and just browsed through it. Love your ideas and looks like you have everything under control. The clutches instead of bouquets is interesting. I never would have come up with that, but I'm going to think about it a bit. That photo from Etsy looks really co...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1893273\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429123458,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80475,"Title":"liked a post you made in Vancouverpetunia - Now Sapp...","Message":"Hello!\n\nVictoriabride just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I'm sure you are not behind. Like I said, I'm a planner and this is my new obsession. I can't believe I already have flower ideas to send to the WC for a quote. LOL I'm a bit of a geek when it comes to this kind of stuff.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1893271\n","Sender":{"Id":282027,"Name":"Victoriabride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429121265,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80369,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1893221\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"vancouverpetunia\" They go just past my knee. I'd say they are more of a 3\/4 length. I was hoping for a bit shorter (knee length) So i'm going to have them hemmed.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429096955,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80367,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  The robes look great and what a good buy. I'll be looking into this. You said they are a bit long. How long are they? The photos on dhgate seem to show both full length and short?\n \n(I assume these are the correct ones: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.dhgat...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1892787\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429096906,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80338,"Title":"liked a post you made in Now Sapphire \/now Jade Brides","Message":"Hello!\n\nracht33 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWe picked Now Sapphire for a couple of reasons. For one, it looks more \"Mexican\" to me. I didn't want to go all the way to Mexico to feel like I was in a slick hotel that could right here in our city (well, other than the weather, the beach, the pools, etc.)  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/> Now Jade looked more...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79064-now-sapphire-now-jade-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1893163\n","Sender":{"Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429092181,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80284,"Title":"approved your friend request","Message":"vancouverpetunia,\n\nWafflesmom has approved your friend request!\n\nLog in and then manage your friends: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=profile&section=friends&do=list\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429080742,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Profile","RelatedItemId":279721},{"Id":79814,"Title":"liked a post you made in Now Sapphire Weddings Forme...","Message":"Hello!\n\njessiker05 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"jessiker05\" data-cid=\"1892931\" data-time=\"1428947741\">Hi everyone,\n \nHow did you all choose between the Tequila Terrace and Beach Terrace? Both look nice, but what are the pros and cons of each?\n \nOur group...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/62152-now-sapphire-weddings-formerly-paradisus-riviera\/?view=findpost&p=1892970\n","Sender":{"Id":279800,"Name":"jessiker05","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428989220,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79769,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Wafflesmom mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78730-20152016-vancouver-or-anywhere-from-bc-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1892989\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"vancouverpetunia\" I've never heard of Show Off! I just checked their Facebook page and the make beautiful dresses. Thanks for the tip, I think I'll visit the store to check it out.\n\nOh and Nordstrom has great dresses too, it's just across the border though\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428959587,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79768,"Title":"liked a post you made in 2015\/2016 Vancouver (Or Any...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I live just off Main and was definitely going to try Barefoot Contessa. I didn't know about their Instagram feed though. Checked it out and there are some cute dresses there that are along the lines of what I'm looking for, so thanks! I also am going to visit Show Off! which does off the ra...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78730-20152016-vancouver-or-anywhere-from-bc-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1892987\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428959425,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"48","TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":2,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
