> User vancouverpetunia (281283)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":11,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":538,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1892652,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1428653747,"LastPoster":{"Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1892652,"PostDate":1428653747,"PostContent":"Hola Senores y senoritas... \u00a0Matt here, yesterday I was doing some droning around in Playa.\u00a0\n\n \u00a0...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1174994040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.121.34","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79046,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Matt Adcock, 10 April 2015 - 08:23 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1428654196,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc928b520aa14c37f436faac82a7d4bb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hola Senores y senoritas... &amp;nbsp;Matt here, yesterday I was doing some droning around in Playa.&amp;nbsp;\n\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ve been following closely the construction of the new &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;[url=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/hyatt-hotel-playa-del-carmen\/&#039;&gt;Hyatt\"]http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/hyatt-hotel-playa-del-carmen\/&#039;&gt;Hyatt[\/url] Playa del Carmen&lt;\/a&gt;, set to open June 1, thought we would share some photos and FAQS (see the link to our blog post) about the new venue! Looks like this is going to be a luxurious wedding venue, family friendly, great beach, wedding gazebo and steps to the famous 5th Avenue of Playa del Carmen. Can&#039;t wait to share more!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anyone booked their upcoming wedding here yet?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80896-hyatt-playa-del-carmen\/\"]&lt;img src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18007\/gallery_207303_18007_34528.jpg\"]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18007\/gallery_207303_18007_34528.jpg\"[\/url] alt=\"gallery_207303_18007_34528.jpg\"&gt;[\/url]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80896-hyatt-playa-del-carmen\/\"]&lt;img src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18007\/gallery_207303_18007_34528.jpg\"]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18007\/gallery_207303_18007_34528.jpg\"[\/url] alt=\"gallery_207303_18007_34528.jpg\"&gt;[\/url]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80898-hyatt-playa-del-carmen\/\"]&lt;img src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18007\/gallery_207303_18007_38658.jpg\"]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18007\/gallery_207303_18007_38658.jpg\"[\/url] alt=\"gallery_207303_18007_38658.jpg\"&gt;[\/url]&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892652,"PostDate":1428653747,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hola Senores y senoritas... \u00a0Matt here, yesterday I was doing some droning around in Playa.\u00a0<br><br>\u00a0<\/p><p>We've been following closely the construction of the new <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/hyatt-hotel-playa-del-carmen\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Hyatt Playa del Carmen<\/a>, set to open June 1, thought we would share some photos and FAQS (see the link to our blog post) about the new venue! Looks like this is going to be a luxurious wedding venue, family friendly, great beach, wedding gazebo and steps to the famous 5th Avenue of Playa del Carmen. Can't wait to share more!<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>Has anyone booked their upcoming wedding here yet?\u00a0<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80896-hyatt-playa-del-carmen\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18007\/gallery_207303_18007_34528.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18007_34528.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80896-hyatt-playa-del-carmen\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18007\/gallery_207303_18007_34528.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18007_34528.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80898-hyatt-playa-del-carmen\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18007\/gallery_207303_18007_38658.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18007_38658.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1174994040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79046,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"696bb683dddc55f112889bd7663cd0b6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Going to check it out this weekend and see who has it and what kind of pricing they&#039;re offering...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892676,"PostDate":1428666265,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Going to check it out this weekend and see who has it and what kind of pricing they're offering...<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283433799,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.149.110","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79046,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"41880dfc73132e21590918eba62b53d2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;After our site visit today....I must say WOW.&amp;nbsp;\n\n\n\nI found that the beach ceremony site has an amazing HUGE hardwood deck for those who want to keep the high heels... they got you covered here! &amp;nbsp; The salons are HUGE, massive ballrooms (that can be made into smaller rooms, but the decorations are wowwwser)\n\n&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/Hyatt-Playa-del-Carmen_V_MA_0053.jpg\" alt=\"Hyatt-Playa-del-Carmen_V_MA_0053.jpg\"&gt;\n\n\n\nHere are some decorations in the ballroom\n&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/Hyatt-Playa-del-Carmen_V_MA_0092.jpg\" alt=\"Hyatt-Playa-del-Carmen_V_MA_0092.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\n\nBut most of all, the view of this place is so so so unbelievable. &amp;nbsp;The breeze is perfect and the property is actually designed around a mangrove, so the inside green spaces are left natural in places and they emphasize the connection w\/ the nature.\n\n&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/Hyatt-Playa-del-Carmen_V_MA_0029.jpg\" alt=\"Hyatt-Playa-del-Carmen_V_MA_0029.jpg\"&gt;\n\n\n\nHope this helps :)   &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892708,"PostDate":1428686763,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>After our site visit today....I must say WOW.\u00a0<br><br><br>\nI found that the beach ceremony site has an amazing HUGE hardwood deck for those who want to keep the high heels... they got you covered here! \u00a0 The salons are HUGE, massive ballrooms (that can be made into smaller rooms, but the decorations are wowwwser)<br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/Hyatt-Playa-del-Carmen_V_MA_0053.jpg\" alt=\"Hyatt-Playa-del-Carmen_V_MA_0053.jpg\"><\/span><br><br><br>\nHere are some decorations in the ballroom<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/Hyatt-Playa-del-Carmen_V_MA_0092.jpg\" alt=\"Hyatt-Playa-del-Carmen_V_MA_0092.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><br>\nBut most of all, the view of this place is so so so unbelievable. \u00a0The breeze is perfect and the property is actually designed around a mangrove, so the inside green spaces are left natural in places and they emphasize the connection w\/ the nature.<br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/Hyatt-Playa-del-Carmen_V_MA_0029.jpg\" alt=\"Hyatt-Playa-del-Carmen_V_MA_0029.jpg\"><\/span><br><br><br>\nHope this helps <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1174994040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.97.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79046,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7ab3764b5143e9c5d47ac9bdf819888d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve been trying to find out from canada who might be putting packages together but not getting anywhere. Did you say June 1st it&#039;s set to open? Odd that I can&#039;t find anyone going yet. We have several very large tour companies so somebody must be adding it to their \"repertoire\"....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892711,"PostDate":1428687568,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I've been trying to find out from canada who might be putting packages together but not getting anywhere. Did you say June 1st it's set to open? Odd that I can't find anyone going yet. We have several very large tour companies so somebody must be adding it to their \"repertoire\"....<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283433799,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.223.128","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79046,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f0bedbcf13a3a93104b7a3272d4d3d2","RawContent":"What I found odd is that on the Hyatt website it doesn&#039;t even mention all inclusive anywhere.  Maybe try to book thru their website and see if you can make headway there. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1892712,"PostDate":1428687738,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                What I found odd is that on the Hyatt website it doesn't even mention all inclusive anywhere.  Maybe try to book thru their website and see if you can make headway there. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399403402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.97.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79046,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"baa5fa95527e5d11ed563d716e9f9ceb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Well I remember when Royalton opened in RM and they were advertising it about 6 months ahead. Sunwing has the exclusive to it like Transat does to Azul Fives but it&#039;s just so odd that nobody has it. I tried itravel2000 since they carry everybody&#039;s packages, plus sell off vacations and nothing listed anywhere. I would be very surprised if it&#039;s not an all inclusive.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892715,"PostDate":1428688556,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Well I remember when Royalton opened in RM and they were advertising it about 6 months ahead. Sunwing has the exclusive to it like Transat does to Azul Fives but it's just so odd that nobody has it. I tried itravel2000 since they carry everybody's packages, plus sell off vacations and nothing listed anywhere. I would be very surprised if it's not an all inclusive.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283433799,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.223.128","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79046,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by calgarybride2015, 10 April 2015 - 06:40 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1428691231,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bfc7be9f40ea4b0b71e79eba491b2350","RawContent":"On Hyatt&#039;s website when you go to book there is a link for all inclusive, so I&#039;m sure it is.  It&#039;s just odd that on Hyatt&#039;s page for this PDC site it doesn&#039;t mention AI anywhere. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1892718,"PostDate":1428691168,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                On Hyatt's website when you go to book there is a link for all inclusive, so I'm sure it is.  It's just odd that on Hyatt's page for this PDC site it doesn't mention AI anywhere. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399403402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.97.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79046,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"16d2701393000110b627191d2c918bfd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow! It&#039;s a beautiful resort! The rooms are just a tiny bit ultra modern for my taste but the colours are gorgeous! Couldn&#039;t find anything about AI though, but even so, using points for a flight is doable.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892727,"PostDate":1428696261,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow! It's a beautiful resort! The rooms are just a tiny bit ultra modern for my taste but the colours are gorgeous! Couldn't find anything about AI though, but even so, using points for a flight is doable.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283433799,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.222.23.60","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79046,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c784ff3f8903b5f79f40fa09bde03513","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1892727\" timestamp=\"1428721461\"]\nWow! It&#039;s a beautiful resort! The rooms are just a tiny bit ultra modern for my taste but the colours are gorgeous! Couldn&#039;t find anything about AI though, but even so, using points for a flight is doable.[\/quote]The hotel is not All Inclusive. \nOne of the things that did stand out during our site visit was that the management is interested in creating very custom and unique experiences and plans to work with each bride.  Focus is on \"[b]Experience[\/b]\" and not necessarily a packaged in the box deal.  Seems they are very flexible and have a lot to offer each couple.  \n\nFrom what I have seen in Playa del Carmen after 7 years of living here, NO HOTEL offers this view: \n[img]http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/Hyatt-Playa-del-Carmen_V_MA_0039.jpg[\/img]\n\nI mean that most properties are actually so close to another one that you see other parts of playa where in this property and the way its been designed you certainly feel like nobody else is around you... Its one of those experiences you must live I think.    \n\nI would suggest for those who are interested in learning more, contact Rocio Cervantes.\n \n[b]Rocio Cervantes [\/b]\n[i]Weddings Sales Manager[\/i]\n[b]HYATT PLAYA DEL CARMEN[\/b]\n1a AVENIDA ESQUINA CALLE 26, PLAYA DEL CARMEN Q. ROO, MEXICO\n[b]T:[\/b] [email=\"+52%20984%20875%201239\"]+52 984 875 1239[\/email] [b] E[\/b]: [email=\"rocio.cervantes@hyatt.com\"]rocio.cervantes@hyatt.com[\/email]","Attachments":[],"Id":1892911,"PostDate":1428911918,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 10 April 2015 - 08:04 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Wow! It's a beautiful resort! The rooms are just a tiny bit ultra modern for my taste but the colours are gorgeous! Couldn't find anything about AI though, but even so, using points for a flight is doable.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\nThe hotel is not All Inclusive.\u00a0<br>\nOne of the things that did stand out during our site visit was that the management is interested in creating very custom and unique experiences and plans to work with each bride. \u00a0Focus is on \"<strong>Experience<\/strong>\" and not necessarily a packaged in the box deal. \u00a0Seems they are very flexible and have a lot to offer each couple. \u00a0<br><br>\nFrom what I have seen in Playa del Carmen after 7 years of living here, NO HOTEL offers this view:\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/Hyatt-Playa-del-Carmen_V_MA_0039.jpg\" alt=\"Hyatt-Playa-del-Carmen_V_MA_0039.jpg\"><\/span><br><br>\nI mean that most properties are actually so close to another one that you see other parts of playa where in this property and the way its been designed you certainly feel like nobody else is around you... Its one of those experiences you must live I think. \u00a0 \u00a0<br><br>\nI would suggest for those who are interested in learning more, contact Rocio Cervantes.<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  class=\"\"><span><b>Rocio Cervantes\u00a0<\/b><\/span><\/p>\n<p  class=\"\"><span><i>Weddings Sales Manager<\/i><\/span><\/p>\n<p  class=\"\"><span><b>HYATT PLAYA DEL CARMEN<\/b><\/span><\/p>\n<p  class=\"\"><span>1a AVENIDA ESQUINA CALLE 26, PLAYA DEL CARMEN Q. ROO, MEXICO<\/span><br><span><b>T:<\/b> <a href='mailto:+52%20984%20875%201239' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span>+52 984 875 1239<\/span><\/a> <b>\u00a0E<\/b>:\u00a0<a href='mailto:rocio.cervantes@hyatt.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span>rocio.cervantes@hyatt.com<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1174994040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.160.162.44","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79046,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4cf05e31a6d6113465cb44d49f2ec001","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi! I am planning my May 2016 wedding, and I reached out to Rocio to get info from her! She respond so fast to let us know that she will be out of the office recruiting, but will get us the info when she returns on Wednesday. I am crossing my fingers this is THE place after looking around for so long!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892995,"PostDate":1428963169,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi! I am planning my May 2016 wedding, and I reached out to Rocio to get info from her! She respond so fast to let us know that she will be out of the office recruiting, but will get us the info when she returns on Wednesday. I am crossing my fingers this is THE place after looking around for so long!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cdmuellerbarrera@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.160.162.44","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428875275,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"badgerbride","Id":282721,"Name":"badgerbride","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79046","Title":"New Venue Opening Soon, Hyatt Playa Del Carmen","LastPostDate":1428997908},"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":2,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
