{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.109.52","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79046,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4cdb0d471b970b2bfed3522d34406d2b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"badgerbride\" post=\"1892995\" timestamp=\"1428988369\"]\nHi! I am planning my May 2016 wedding, and I reached out to Rocio to get info from her! She respond so fast to let us know that she will be out of the office recruiting, but will get us the info when she returns on Wednesday. I am crossing my fingers this is THE place after looking around for so long![\/quote]\nFingers crossed for you @[member=\"badgerbride\"]! Keep us posted, looking forward to seeing how it&#039;s going for you!","Attachments":[],"Id":1893042,"PostDate":1428997908,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>badgerbride, on 13 April 2015 - 10:12 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi! I am planning my May 2016 wedding, and I reached out to Rocio to get info from her! She respond so fast to let us know that she will be out of the office recruiting, but will get us the info when she returns on Wednesday. I am crossing my fingers this is THE place after looking around for so long!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Fingers crossed for you @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282721-badgerbride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">badgerbride<\/span><\/a>! Keep us posted, looking forward to seeing how it's going for you!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1174994040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":2,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
