{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.74.107.210","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f21fad8759f805ef1c88f4e6598ae4bf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Heyyy !&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;I just wanted to introduce myself and start communicating with all of you other future brides. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;I just booked this resort for my wedding in 2016. &amp;nbsp;I just received confirmation yesterday and I am super excited =) I visited this resort October 2014 and loved it!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892288,"PostDate":1428477117,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Heyyy !\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0I just wanted to introduce myself and start communicating with all of you other future brides. \u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I just booked this resort for my wedding in 2016. \u00a0I just received confirmation yesterday and I am super excited =) I visited this resort October 2014 and loved it!\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tammi1025@icloud.com","IpAddress":"50.74.107.210","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416823400,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Tammi1025","Id":281239,"Name":"Tammi1025","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.109.52","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf37d5efbff8ed9d8facfccdd709d0ca","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/ocean-coral-and-turquesa\/&#039;&gt;Ocean Coral and Turquesa wedding&lt;\/a&gt; planners! Congratulations to you all, a lovely choice of venue for a destination wedding. The resort has a \"homey\" feel to it, we love the colorful architecture set amidst the palm trees and rustic palapas. Great place for a beach ceremony and a terrace reception.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80881-wedding-puerto-morelos-ocean-coral\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_160888.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_160888.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80882-wedding-puerto-morelos-ocean-coral\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_76138.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_76138.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80876-destination-wedding-ocean-coral-turquesa\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_126062.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_126062.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80877-destination-wedding-ocean-coral-turquesa\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_81453.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_81453.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80878-destination-wedding-ocean-coral-turquesa\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_65959.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_65959.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80879-destination-wedding-ocean-coral-turquesa\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_105737.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_105737.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80880-wedding-puerto-morelos-ocean-coral\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_43741.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_43741.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80883-wedding-puerto-morelos-ocean-coral\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_58776.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_58776.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80884-wedding-puerto-morelos-ocean-coral\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_3789.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_3789.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning, please let us know if we can assist with anything!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892323,"PostDate":1428484318,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/tag\/ocean-coral-and-turquesa\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Ocean Coral and Turquesa wedding<\/a> planners! Congratulations to you all, a lovely choice of venue for a destination wedding. The resort has a \"homey\" feel to it, we love the colorful architecture set amidst the palm trees and rustic palapas. Great place for a beach ceremony and a terrace reception.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80881-wedding-puerto-morelos-ocean-coral\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_160888.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_160888.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80882-wedding-puerto-morelos-ocean-coral\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_76138.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_76138.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80876-destination-wedding-ocean-coral-turquesa\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_126062.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_126062.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80877-destination-wedding-ocean-coral-turquesa\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_81453.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_81453.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80878-destination-wedding-ocean-coral-turquesa\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_65959.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_65959.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80879-destination-wedding-ocean-coral-turquesa\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_105737.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_105737.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80880-wedding-puerto-morelos-ocean-coral\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_43741.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_43741.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80883-wedding-puerto-morelos-ocean-coral\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_58776.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_58776.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80884-wedding-puerto-morelos-ocean-coral\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18005\/gallery_207303_18005_3789.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_18005_3789.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning, please let us know if we can assist with anything!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1174994040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.31.103.240","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c6167777cf9830ca0dbe7f3c68a1b3f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Have you ladies seen the wedding the resort posted on there facebook page??? Its Absolutely beautiful!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892719,"PostDate":1428692937,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Have you ladies seen the wedding the resort posted on there facebook page??? Its Absolutely beautiful!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessica.i.fowlie@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.251.152.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412687942,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280350.jpg?_r=1415224690","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BeachBrideJess","Id":280350,"Name":"BeachBrideJess","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.50.168.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27597,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ba91bf20ec8b40a1ac0924e6cfa5d27","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;To previous OCT Brides: how long did you have between your ceremony &amp;amp; reception? &amp;nbsp;Our ceremony is at 4 and im thinking we should have the reception at 7:00 to allow time for the champagne toast, photos, and then have 7-10 reception with 10-10:30 free to freshen up for the pool party.. any thoughts or feedback?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892784,"PostDate":1428745767,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>To previous OCT Brides: how long did you have between your ceremony & reception? \u00a0Our ceremony is at 4 and im thinking we should have the reception at 7:00 to allow time for the champagne toast, photos, and then have 7-10 reception with 10-10:30 free to freshen up for the pool party.. any thoughts or feedback?<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"owenmegan2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.66.18.227","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419895332,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"meganlocke7","Id":281521,"Name":"meganlocke7","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2394,"TotalPages":240,"CurrentPage":2390,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":2380,"LastPage":2390},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":2,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
