{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":79754,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Wafflesmom mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78730-20152016-vancouver-or-anywhere-from-bc-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1892984\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"vancouverpetunia\" Blue, green and purple (peacock colours) are so elegant. I love that colour scheme. And those robes totally match your vision. \n\nIf you're not planning on wearing a dressy dress, then I would suggest not going to a bridal store. A lot of the dresses were quite formal so you may be limited. Have you checked out Main Street (around 25th and 16th). They have some great boutiques with beautiful dresses. My favourite is Barefoot Contessa. They have an Instagram page where you can check out their new arrivals. Aside from that, the Bay (especially online) has been wowing me lately with their dress selections. Plus it's Bay days right now so there's plenty of dresses on sale. I'll keep thinking for you but those come to mind.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428953936,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79751,"Title":"liked a post you made in 2015\/2016 Vancouver (Or Any...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I saw that La Vie en Rose sale posted on the weekend and bought 3 robes online yesterday! My first wedding purchase  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> We are doing peacock colours (but not a peacock theme) - blue, green and maybe some purple. At least I think we are. I only decided that yesterday morning and then sa...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78730-20152016-vancouver-or-anywhere-from-bc-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1892983\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428953548,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79738,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Wafflesmom mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78730-20152016-vancouver-or-anywhere-from-bc-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1892980\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"vancouverpetunia\" you're in great company, there are a lot of planners on here, myself included  You're lucky you did a site visit, we unfortunately aren't able to but we've had a lit of friends who gave been to Moon Palace and have assured us that we're in good hands. What have you decided on in terms of colours? Ours are coral and grey. I'm not sure if you're thinking about getting ready robes but La Vie En Rose is currently have a 3 for 1 sale and there's a peach, and a navy kimono that's included. They are pretty so I got some and took advantage of the sale!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428949286,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79737,"Title":"liked a post you made in 2015\/2016 Vancouver (Or Any...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nHi @ ! Wow, two more BC brides, I'm so happy!! How's your wedding planning?\n-----------------------------\n\n \nThings are coming along for us. We are confirmed at Now Sapphire for Apri...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78730-20152016-vancouver-or-anywhere-from-bc-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1892967\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428949032,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79732,"Title":"liked a post you made in 2015\/2016 Vancouver (Or Any...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nHi @ ! Wow, two more BC brides, I'm so happy!! How's your wedding planning?\n-----------------------------\n\n \nThings are coming along for us. We are confirmed at Now Sapphire for Apri...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78730-20152016-vancouver-or-anywhere-from-bc-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1892967\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428948012,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79586,"Title":"liked a post you made in Now Sapphire Weddings Forme...","Message":"Hello!\n\njessiker05 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHello fellow Sapphire brides! We were in PDC last week for a last minute vacation and had the opportunity to visit Now Sapphire, meet with Juan Carlos and do a menu tasting. Overall the food was all very good, but I thought you might be interested in our opinions on the food we tried. Keep in...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/62152-now-sapphire-weddings-formerly-paradisus-riviera\/?view=findpost&p=1892795\n","Sender":{"Id":279800,"Name":"jessiker05","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428916006,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79527,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Wafflesmom mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78730-20152016-vancouver-or-anywhere-from-bc-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1892888\n\n----------------------------------\nHi @\"vancouverpetunia\"! Wow, two more BC brides, I'm so happy!! How's your wedding planning?\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428875905,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79454,"Title":"liked a post you made in 3 For 1 Kimonos At La Vie E...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThanks so much for this tip! I just bought 3 of the blue ones online. My wedding's not for a year, but a great price and La Vie en Rose usually has really nice stuff. Plus I just decided on my colors today and this matches!  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"acw271011...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79049-3-for-1-kimonos-at-la-vie-en-rose-boutique\/?view=findpost&p=1892859\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428858347,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79449,"Title":"liked a post you made in 3 For 1 Kimonos At La Vie E...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThanks so much for this tip! I just bought 3 of the blue ones online. My wedding's not for a year, but a great price and La Vie en Rose usually has really nice stuff. Plus I just decided on my colors today and this matches!  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"acw271011...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79049-3-for-1-kimonos-at-la-vie-en-rose-boutique\/?view=findpost&p=1892859\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428857141,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79299,"Title":"liked a post you made in Calling For Rain On Your We...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWe were just in PDC last week. Before we left, there was lots of rain & thundershowers showing up in the forecast. But while we were there, it rained only once, and I would barely even call that rain. We didn't even bother to get up off our loungers.\n \nI've been to the are...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79043-calling-for-rain-on-your-wedding-day\/?view=findpost&p=1892782\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428781240,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79290,"Title":"liked a post you made in Calling For Rain On Your We...","Message":"Hello!\n\nkimmyd2 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWe were just in PDC last week. Before we left, there was lots of rain & thundershowers showing up in the forecast. But while we were there, it rained only once, and I would barely even call that rain. We didn't even bother to get up off our loungers.\n \nI've been to the are...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79043-calling-for-rain-on-your-wedding-day\/?view=findpost&p=1892782\n","Sender":{"Id":280238,"Name":"kimmyd2","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280238.png?_r=1412619945","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":60,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428773079,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79287,"Title":"liked a post you made in Calling For Rain On Your We...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWe were just in PDC last week. Before we left, there was lots of rain & thundershowers showing up in the forecast. But while we were there, it rained only once, and I would barely even call that rain. We didn't even bother to get up off our loungers.\n \nI've been to the are...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79043-calling-for-rain-on-your-wedding-day\/?view=findpost&p=1892782\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428768559,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75761,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that IzzyDeee mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78992-one-bridesmaid-driving-me-nuts-rant\/?view=findpost&p=1891061\n\n----------------------------------\nBelieve me I realize not everyone cares about every event but she hasn't made an effort to come to even a single one @\"vancouverpetunia\" the first event was over a year ago with the next one not being until a month or so ago and the next event is my bachelorette on April 11th which she can't come to either. My other bridal shower is the next weekend  and then we only have the next weekend and then the next we leave!! So it's not like I've had event after event after event! There have been months in between and tons of advanced notice as well as a few reminders closer to the date of the event and she acts like she is going to come and all excited but bails last minute. I'd prefer if she was just upfront with me and stated she didn't want to come so I don't get my hopes up! It's just common courtesy.\n\nI will be enjoying my 2 weeks to the upmost fullest! If people are going to act shady I will just do me! [emoji4]\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1426462827","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427478142,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":74864,"Title":"liked a post you made in Entertaining Guest Outside...","Message":"Hello!\n\nSmellsey just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  - Sorry thought there was a way to share files through the site (oops I'm a noob). Email is ekjzwedding-at-gmail.com. Thanks. Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78942-entertaining-guest-outside-of-resort\/?view=findpost&p=1890237\n","Sender":{"Id":279143,"Name":"Smellsey","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279143.jpg?_r=1411496026","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427184360,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":74862,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"vancouverpetunia,\n\nSmellsey has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"email address for excursion companies\".\n\nSmellsey said:\n======================================================================\nI just did <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9103&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":279143,"Name":"Smellsey","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279143.jpg?_r=1411496026","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427184184,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9103},{"Id":73889,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Smellsey mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78942-entertaining-guest-outside-of-resort\/?view=findpost&p=1890157\n\n----------------------------------\nI am doing an excursion as m y oot bags and a thank you. It is about $3500 or so.\n \n@\"vancouverpetunia\" What is your email address?\n \nall of the catamaran's differ. some offer fishing, some not.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279143,"Name":"Smellsey","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279143.jpg?_r=1411496026","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426839572,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73599,"Title":"liked a post you made in Entertaining Guest Outside...","Message":"Hello!\n\nracht33 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI attended a wedding a few years ago in Tulum where we did a catamaran\/snorkeling excursion. It was so much fun that my FI and I are thinking of doing something similar. I'm not sure who paid for the excursion in Tulum, but it was not the guests. We are planning on paying for the excursion our...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78942-entertaining-guest-outside-of-resort\/?view=findpost&p=1889997\n","Sender":{"Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426753137,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":72029,"Title":"liked a post you made in January 2016 Mexico Bride -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nJenniferH114 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  - Thank you so much for the vendor info. Better than ordering from the US, even if it's not local. If anyone can recommend a vendor local to Playa del Carmen or Cancun for papel picado, please let me know!\n \n@  - I'm sure everyone is different as to how much time they want...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78808-january-2016-mexico-bride-planning-and-budget\/?view=findpost&p=1889046\n","Sender":{"Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426154185,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"48","TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":2,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
