{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.192.32.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78902,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac7fd6e854507b58b31d89fc38f8c1e3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Shipwrecked2015\" post=\"1889243\" timestamp=\"1426351860\"]\nWe&#039;ve been talking to Katy at Love &amp;amp; Lace Decor in Playa. Look them up on Facebook and look at her albums to see items for rent.  You can pick up items from her off of the property and bring them in on your own.  Saves you from having to pack them or pay a vendor fee.\n[\/quote]Yes I did email her! She didn&#039;t have all those vases but she had one size. Are you renting from her? What are you renting? I wish u could just get from her then I wouldn&#039;t have to worry about it!\nI kind of like this too.. Very simple. Does anyone know where I could find a white tray like this??","Attachments":[],"Id":1889384,"PostDate":1426482481,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Shipwrecked2015, on 14 March 2015 - 09:51 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>We've been talking to Katy at Love & Lace Decor in Playa. Look them up on Facebook and look at her albums to see items for rent. \u00a0You can pick up items from her off of the property and bring them in on your own. \u00a0Saves you from having to pack them or pay a vendor fee.<br><\/p><\/div><\/div>\nYes I did email her! She didn't have all those vases but she had one size. Are you renting from her? What are you renting? I wish u could just get from her then I wouldn't have to worry about it!<br \/>I kind of like this too.. Very simple. Does anyone know where I could find a white tray like this??<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1889384]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-279723-0-07524700-1426507666.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  120.02KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-279723-0-07524700-1426507666.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lornj29@aim.com","IpAddress":"68.192.37.147","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410083820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lornj29","Id":279723,"Name":"lornj29","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78902,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f134f49f39093835fd940c7a80278c72","RawContent":"I&#039;d try Michael&#039;s or even Walmart. Look in the craft and kitchen section. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1889391,"PostDate":1426486138,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'd try Michael's or even Walmart. Look in the craft and kitchen section. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399403402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.139.53.63","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78902,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"40ebf9964c437d824f524acceee9a0ce","RawContent":"@[member=\"lornj29\"] ya, I can put a photo on here once I get it together. I&#039;m kinda sick right now, but soon I&#039;ll get it together and show u!\nAnd my florist resurfaced after 2 + weeks. Said was on vacation for a month. Lol ok...","Attachments":[],"Id":1889419,"PostDate":1426498706,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279723\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279723-lornj29\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">lornj29<\/span><\/a> ya, I can put a photo on here once I get it together. I'm kinda sick right now, but soon I'll get it together and show u!<br \/>And my florist resurfaced after 2 + weeks. Said was on vacation for a month. Lol ok...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401111233,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.46.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78902,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e7da2c18be0bb1afd02bdc6898dab11","RawContent":"That looks really pretty! Is that a burlap table runner? I was thinking of doing that but can&#039;t find any that won&#039;t break the budget! For some reason all the ones I saw were over $10 each and that isn&#039;t worth it to me since I need at least 8.\n[quote name=\"lornj29\" post=\"1889341\" timestamp=\"1426468369\"]\nWow so what are you bringing down?? Do you have a picture of the centerpiece you are doing? I don&#039;t know weather to do the flowers in water or just bring down the candles in the cylinder vases. Which florist are you using in riviera maya?\nI made this just to see what it would look like what do ya think?\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=30915\"]image.jpg[\/url][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1889438,"PostDate":1426503565,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>That looks really pretty! Is that a burlap table runner? I was thinking of doing that but can't find any that won't break the budget! For some reason all the ones I saw were over $10 each and that isn't worth it to me since I need at least 8.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lornj29, on 15 March 2015 - 06:12 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Wow so what are you bringing down?? Do you have a picture of the centerpiece you are doing? I don't know weather to do the flowers in water or just bring down the candles in the cylinder vases. Which florist are you using in riviera maya?<br>\nI made this just to see what it would look like what do ya think?<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=30915' class='bbc_url' title=''>image.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403090887,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78902,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1426578625,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b95c0883f11477597cd0a75c8142632","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] @[member=\"Shipwrecked2015\"] Anyone know where I can see Love and Lace Reviews other than the few listed on the FB? Im really interested in maybe doing this then having to bring all this decor with me next year. this will really help with package cost and customs. Does anyone know of any other decor rental places to compare to Love and Lace?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanx for the help!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889659,"PostDate":1426578591,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279531\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279531-shipwrecked2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Shipwrecked2015<\/span><\/a> Anyone know where I can see Love and Lace Reviews other than the few listed on the FB? Im really interested in maybe doing this then having to bring all this decor with me next year. this will really help with package cost and customs. Does anyone know of any other decor rental places to compare to Love and Lace?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanx for the help!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422607788,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78902,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b31eb338b01e5c3c727c265d515bf79f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"racht33\" post=\"1889659\" timestamp=\"1426603791\"]\n@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] @[member=\"Shipwrecked2015\"] Anyone know where I can see Love and Lace Reviews other than the few listed on the FB? Im really interested in maybe doing this then having to bring all this decor with me next year. this will really help with package cost and customs. Does anyone know of any other decor rental places to compare to Love and Lace?\n\nThanx for the help![\/quote]I haven&#039;t used her and I&#039;m not sure I will. Not because I don&#039;t think she&#039;s good, I&#039;m not using a lot of decor so I have bought most things. However, she&#039;s always been really responsive when I contacted her and I know of a few people that used her services and they were very happy. I don&#039;t know of anyone else that does this sadly. \n\nI would ask @[member=\"reynbow\"] or @[member=\"khmciver\"]. Both of them rented out stuff from her.","Attachments":[],"Id":1889672,"PostDate":1426579689,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>racht33, on 17 March 2015 - 07:49 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279531\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279531-shipwrecked2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Shipwrecked2015<\/span><\/a> Anyone know where I can see Love and Lace Reviews other than the few listed on the FB? Im really interested in maybe doing this then having to bring all this decor with me next year. this will really help with package cost and customs. Does anyone know of any other decor rental places to compare to Love and Lace?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanx for the help!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I haven't used her and I'm not sure I will. Not because I don't think she's good, I'm not using a lot of decor so I have bought most things. However, she's always been really responsive when I contacted her and I know of a few people that used her services and they were very happy. I don't know of anyone else that does this sadly.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would ask @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276575\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276575-reynbow\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">reynbow<\/span><\/a> or @khmciver. Both of them rented out stuff from her.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359737904,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78902,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dbb68b99a9e581d1558bc2045c52397e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] thank you! I will contact them and see if they have any further info they can share. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889685,"PostDate":1426582465,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> thank you! I will contact them and see if they have any further info they can share. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422607788,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.103.247.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78902,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c31db581d69766f34323d7a1ee0cde68","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lornj29\" post=\"1889384\" timestamp=\"1426507681\"]\nYes I did email her! She didn&#039;t have all those vases but she had one size. Are you renting from her? What are you renting? I wish u could just get from her then I wouldn&#039;t have to worry about it!\nI kind of like this too.. Very simple. Does anyone know where I could find a white tray like this??[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=30928\"]image.jpg[\/url][\/quote]\nNot sure that we&#039;re renting anything from Love &amp;amp; Lace yet - possibly signs, baskets, napkins, and\/or birdcage type things.  I just know that she has lots of candle and centerpiece items and she seems well-versed in renting to clients who want to avoid outside vendor fees.  \nWe&#039;re getting our centerpieces and flowers from Cherry Blossom in Playa.  Sandra has been great and their prices are excellent compared to other vendors we&#039;ve seen in the area.  We&#039;re bringing down our own tea candles for the centerpieces since they&#039;re $3.99 for a bag of 100 at Ikea and they have to pay WAY more than that locally.  Cherry Blossom might do the off-property handoff thing but I&#039;m not sure because it&#039;s not an issue for us.  It&#039;s worth asking.","Attachments":[],"Id":1889696,"PostDate":1426585280,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lornj29, on 16 March 2015 - 05:08 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Yes I did email her! She didn't have all those vases but she had one size. Are you renting from her? What are you renting? I wish u could just get from her then I wouldn't have to worry about it!<br>\nI kind of like this too.. Very simple. Does anyone know where I could find a white tray like this??<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=30928' class='bbc_url' title=''>image.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Not sure that we're renting anything from Love & Lace yet - possibly signs, baskets, napkins, and\/or birdcage type things. \u00a0I just know that she has lots of candle and centerpiece items and she seems well-versed in renting to clients who want to avoid outside vendor fees. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're getting our centerpieces and flowers from Cherry Blossom in Playa. \u00a0Sandra has been great and their prices are excellent compared to other vendors we've seen in the area. \u00a0We're bringing down our own tea candles for the centerpieces since they're $3.99 for a bag of 100 at Ikea and they have to pay WAY more than that locally. \u00a0Cherry Blossom might do the off-property handoff thing but I'm not sure because it's not an issue for us. \u00a0It's worth asking.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>The rumors are true - I'm a groom.","Email":"jzspitzig@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.103.247.154","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1408703887,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279531.png?_r=1415042537","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Shipwrecked2015","Id":279531,"Name":"Shipwrecked2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.148.255.86","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78902,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bdec65551b78d19fb4e0753de6ae589f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"racht33\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I used Love &amp;amp; Lace and she was AWESOME. It all started because I really wanted those lights that are the bulbs on the string. There has to be a better way for me to explain that. :) Anyway, the hotel was going to charge me $200 for a strand of lights. They told me I needed at least 10 strands. That&#039;s when I read about Katy on this site somewhere. She charged like $15 per strand. Clearly so much cheaper. I literally rented almost everything she has. You name it, I rented it..lights, chargers, vases, burlap runners, lace runners, chair sashes, candles, paper bags to line the pool...the list goes on and one. I rented everything and it was awesome. It looked absolutely stunning. She&#039;s great to work with too. She&#039;s very responsive and so organized. She arranged a time for me to meet her in town and get everything from her. Then I didn&#039;t have to pay an outside vendor fee. She even got sparklers for me which was great! I really wanted sparklers and the hotel was going to charge me $8\/sparkler!!! She even bought matches for me. Of course, I paid her...but she&#039;s the best. I HIGHLY recommend using her. She saved me on cost a lot. A LOT. I was already bringing so many suitcases with everything welcome bag oriented so I didn&#039;t have room for decorations. I even rented sheers and a \"light wall\" from her. It was beautiful. &amp;nbsp;You can always email me at khmciver@[member=\"gmail\"].com and I&#039;m happy to answer more questions. I&#039;ll find some pics to post.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"racht33\"] Here are some pictures. @[member=\"lornj29\"] I would check Container Store for a tray or target. I saw white lacquer trays at both of those recently. :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:17986]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80476]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80472]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889760,"PostDate":1426601980,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281952\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281952-racht33\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">racht33<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>I used Love & Lace and she was AWESOME. It all started because I really wanted those lights that are the bulbs on the string. There has to be a better way for me to explain that. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Anyway, the hotel was going to charge me $200 for a strand of lights. They told me I needed at least 10 strands. That's when I read about Katy on this site somewhere. She charged like $15 per strand. Clearly so much cheaper. I literally rented almost everything she has. You name it, I rented it..lights, chargers, vases, burlap runners, lace runners, chair sashes, candles, paper bags to line the pool...the list goes on and one. I rented everything and it was awesome. It looked absolutely stunning. She's great to work with too. She's very responsive and so organized. She arranged a time for me to meet her in town and get everything from her. Then I didn't have to pay an outside vendor fee. She even got sparklers for me which was great! I really wanted sparklers and the hotel was going to charge me $8\/sparkler!!! She even bought matches for me. Of course, I paid her...but she's the best. I HIGHLY recommend using her. She saved me on cost a lot. A LOT. I was already bringing so many suitcases with everything welcome bag oriented so I didn't have room for decorations. I even rented sheers and a \"light wall\" from her. It was beautiful. \u00a0You can always email me at khmciver@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com and I'm happy to answer more questions. I'll find some pics to post.\u00a0<\/p><br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281952\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281952-racht33\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">racht33<\/span><\/a> Here are some pictures. @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279723\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279723-lornj29\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">lornj29<\/span><\/a> I would check Container Store for a tray or target. I saw white lacquer trays at both of those recently. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<div><div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/17986-love-lace\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17986\/tn_gallery_275598_17986_4406.jpg' class='sharedmedia_screenshot cover_img_75' title='1'  width='75' height='75'  alt='1' id='tn_image_view_80466_cover' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/17986-love-lace\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Album: Love & Lace<\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div>34 images<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>0 comments<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80476-11\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17986\/sml_gallery_275598_17986_23990.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='11'  width='200' height='134'  alt='11' id='sml_image_view_80476' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80472-7\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17986\/sml_gallery_275598_17986_86647.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='7'  width='200' height='134'  alt='7' id='sml_image_view_80472' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Wedding Date: November 1, 2015<br>\nWedding Location: Azul Fives Hotel in Playa del Carmen<\/p>\n<p>Photographer: Photos in Cancun - Derek Campbell<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com'>http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Decoration Rentals: Love & Lace Wedding Decor<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor<\/a><\/p>\n<div>Wedding Photo Album: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f<\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"khmciver@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1386782354,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275598.jpg?_r=1426649427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellymenning","Id":275598,"Name":"kellymenning","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78902,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1426655692,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ecc1a9bc7f23c0ee70d91cf465266a5","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kellymenning\" post=\"1889760\" timestamp=\"1426627180\"]\n\n@[member=\"racht33\"]\nI used Love &amp;amp; Lace and she was AWESOME. It all started because I really wanted those lights that are the bulbs on the string. There has to be a better way for me to explain that. :) Anyway, the hotel was going to charge me $200 for a strand of lights. They told me I needed at least 10 strands. That&#039;s when I read about Katy on this site somewhere. She charged like $15 per strand. Clearly so much cheaper. I literally rented almost everything she has. You name it, I rented it..lights, chargers, vases, burlap runners, lace runners, chair sashes, candles, paper bags to line the pool...the list goes on and one. I rented everything and it was awesome. It looked absolutely stunning. She&#039;s great to work with too. She&#039;s very responsive and so organized. She arranged a time for me to meet her in town and get everything from her. Then I didn&#039;t have to pay an outside vendor fee. She even got sparklers for me which was great! I really wanted sparklers and the hotel was going to charge me $8\/sparkler!!! She even bought matches for me. Of course, I paid her...but she&#039;s the best. I HIGHLY recommend using her. She saved me on cost a lot. A LOT. I was already bringing so many suitcases with everything welcome bag oriented so I didn&#039;t have room for decorations. I even rented sheers and a \"light wall\" from her. It was beautiful.  You can always email me at khmciver@[member=\"gmail\"].com and I&#039;m happy to answer more questions. I&#039;ll find some pics to post. \n\n@[member=\"racht33\"] Here are some pictures. @[member=\"lornj29\"] I would check Container Store for a tray or target. I saw white lacquer trays at both of those recently. :)\n\n\n\n\n[\/quote]\n\nThank you so much for this info!! These pictures are amazing!!! I love the handing bottles its gorg! Did she do those for you as well? THe flowers you have hanging from the gazebo are those from Love and Lace ? or did the resort set this up for you ? I have NEVER seen this and Im so in love with it!","Attachments":[],"Id":1889799,"PostDate":1426655641,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kellymenning, on 17 March 2015 - 02:19 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281952\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281952-racht33\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">racht33<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>I used Love & Lace and she was AWESOME. It all started because I really wanted those lights that are the bulbs on the string. There has to be a better way for me to explain that. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Anyway, the hotel was going to charge me $200 for a strand of lights. They told me I needed at least 10 strands. That's when I read about Katy on this site somewhere. She charged like $15 per strand. Clearly so much cheaper. I literally rented almost everything she has. You name it, I rented it..lights, chargers, vases, burlap runners, lace runners, chair sashes, candles, paper bags to line the pool...the list goes on and one. I rented everything and it was awesome. It looked absolutely stunning. She's great to work with too. She's very responsive and so organized. She arranged a time for me to meet her in town and get everything from her. Then I didn't have to pay an outside vendor fee. She even got sparklers for me which was great! I really wanted sparklers and the hotel was going to charge me $8\/sparkler!!! She even bought matches for me. Of course, I paid her...but she's the best. I HIGHLY recommend using her. She saved me on cost a lot. A LOT. I was already bringing so many suitcases with everything welcome bag oriented so I didn't have room for decorations. I even rented sheers and a \"light wall\" from her. It was beautiful. \u00a0You can always email me at khmciver@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com and I'm happy to answer more questions. I'll find some pics to post.\u00a0<\/p>\n<br><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281952\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281952-racht33\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">racht33<\/span><\/a> Here are some pictures. @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279723\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279723-lornj29\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">lornj29<\/span><\/a> I would check Container Store for a tray or target. I saw white lacquer trays at both of those recently. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you so much for this info!! These pictures are amazing!!! I love the handing bottles its gorg! Did she do those for you as well? THe flowers you have hanging from the gazebo are those from Love and Lace ? or did the resort set this up for you ? I have NEVER seen this and Im so in love with it!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422607788,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":34,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":2,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
