t some thought into this.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857948,"PostDate":1404297751,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I really didn't realize how expensive the flowers were at the resorts. I'm going to have to put some thought into this.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spadeincwedding@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.226.206.246","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396376980,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277449.jpg?_r=1404699929","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":259,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NixSpade","Id":277449,"Name":"NixSpade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.3.138.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76963,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e54bbba99dfdbc9f4c79e32e4ede5fdd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Peonies are VERY expensive (I was quoted $30 a single stem!) Things like gerbera daisies, babys breath, alstroemeria, lilys, and actually roses seem to be cheapest&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858675,"PostDate":1404837743,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Peonies are VERY expensive (I was quoted $30 a single stem!) Things like gerbera daisies, babys breath, alstroemeria, lilys, and actually roses seem to be cheapest\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<div>\n<p><span>Soon to be a Carrera<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>Secrets Vallarta Bay<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>November 2014<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"petersonkatiem@gmail.com","IpAddress":"12.189.17.130","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1367012906,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269020.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"futurekcarrera","Id":269020,"Name":"futurekcarrera","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76963,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1425084505,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"56d1355b97e28fbaf0d1550651d3f0ae","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Tulip are the best for wedding.&amp;nbsp;\n&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/736x\/fc\/29\/42\/fc294225192054dcc60c2a55821b48a1.jpg\" alt=\"fc294225192054dcc60c2a55821b48a1.jpg\"&gt;\n\nThis is the one which you are talking about.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887795,"PostDate":1425084316,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Tulip are the best for wedding.\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/736x\/fc\/29\/42\/fc294225192054dcc60c2a55821b48a1.jpg\" alt=\"fc294225192054dcc60c2a55821b48a1.jpg\"><\/span><br>\nThis is the one which you are talking about.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katherineriverace@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425075517,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282278.png?_r=1425103909","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":242,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RitvikSehgal","Id":282278,"Name":"RitvikSehgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.109.52","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76963,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5177f6e322cc4e2822da34cbc0b1b7e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Flowers are such a big part of the wedding, it is definitely worthwhile checking around for vendors, not only for prices but to match your style and \"vibe\". If I may, I&#039;d like to mention some outside vendors that do lovely floral work, like &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/stylist\/maya-diseno-floral\/&#039;&gt;Maya Diseno Floral&lt;\/a&gt;, &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/stylist\/vanessa-jaimes-floral-design\/&#039;&gt;Vanessa Jaimes Floral Design&lt;\/a&gt;, &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/stylist\/cherry-blossom\/&#039;&gt;Cherry Blossom&lt;\/a&gt;, &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/stylist\/flores-riviera-maya\/&#039;&gt;Flores Riviera Maya&lt;\/a&gt;, and &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/stylist\/planner-1-events\/&#039;&gt;Planner 1 Events&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;just to name a few. (Clicking the links will take you to weddings with floral design by that vendor). You can also follow our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/delsolphoto\/bridal-bouquets\/&#039;&gt;\"Bridal Bouquet\" board on Pinterest&lt;\/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here are a few inspirational floral photos (you can almost smell the roses!) We notice a trend towards succulents in the bouquets lately!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80202-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_48937.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_48937.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80204-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_4481.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_4481.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80197-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_31511.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_31511.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80199-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_16112.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_16112.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80200-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_27317.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_27317.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80201-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_23090.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_23090.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80203-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_23394.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_23394.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80205-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_49144.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_49144.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80207-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_35371.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_35371.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80208-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_30290.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_30290.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888330,"PostDate":1425469920,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Flowers are such a big part of the wedding, it is definitely worthwhile checking around for vendors, not only for prices but to match your style and \"vibe\". If I may, I'd like to mention some outside vendors that do lovely floral work, like <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/stylist\/maya-diseno-floral\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Maya Diseno Floral<\/a>, <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/stylist\/vanessa-jaimes-floral-design\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Vanessa Jaimes Floral Design<\/a>, <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/stylist\/cherry-blossom\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cherry Blossom<\/a>, <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/stylist\/flores-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Flores Riviera Maya<\/a>, and <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/stylist\/planner-1-events\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Planner 1 Events<\/a>\u00a0just to name a few. (Clicking the links will take you to weddings with floral design by that vendor). You can also follow our <a href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/delsolphoto\/bridal-bouquets\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>\"Bridal Bouquet\" board on Pinterest<\/a>.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are a few inspirational floral photos (you can almost smell the roses!) We notice a trend towards succulents in the bouquets lately!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80202-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_48937.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_48937.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80204-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_4481.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_4481.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80197-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_31511.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_31511.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80199-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_16112.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_16112.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80200-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_27317.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_27317.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80201-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_23090.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_23090.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80203-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_23394.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_23394.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80205-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_49144.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_49144.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80207-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_35371.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_35371.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80208-bridal-bouquets-for-destination-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17970\/gallery_207303_17970_30290.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17970_30290.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1174994040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":15,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":2,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
