> User vancouverpetunia (281283)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":38,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1565,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1844720,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":239790,"Name":"Mrsktobe","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239790.jpg?_r=1406921722","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1397648157,"LastPoster":{"Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":43,"Preview":{"Id":1844720,"PostDate":1397648157,"PostContent":"Hi Ladies! \u00a0 Happy Wednesday  \u00a0 I just wanted to see if there was any other ladies on here who ar...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lcboyko@ualberta.ca","IpAddress":"23.17.180.191","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1304947091,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239790.jpg?_r=1406921722","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mrsktobe","Id":239790,"Name":"Mrsktobe","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.18.213.150","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76866,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32a10a6fdd688eaef3e69b622b4c1704","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Wednesday :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I just wanted to see if there was any other ladies on here who are having a simple wedding in terms of decoration and such? I keep looking through the forum here and seeing such wonderful ideas from other ladies so I feel like maybe I should do more?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I know&amp;nbsp;every bride is different and it&#039;s just not me to spend tons of money on d\u00e9cor. Don&#039;t get me wrong, I am bringing down things for&amp;nbsp;the tables and for the card table and lighting (Getting married at a beach club)&amp;nbsp;and it&#039;s not going to look empty, I just am not spending the money on flowers or candles or for our ceremony d\u00e9cor like other women are... Not that anything is wrong with spending money on those things though!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyone else similar? LOL It would make me feel better!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1844720,"PostDate":1397648157,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Wednesday <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just wanted to see if there was any other ladies on here who are having a simple wedding in terms of decoration and such? I keep looking through the forum here and seeing such wonderful ideas from other ladies so I feel like maybe I should do more?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know\u00a0every bride is different and it's just not me to spend tons of money on d\u00e9cor. Don't get me wrong, I am bringing down things for\u00a0the tables and for the card table and lighting (Getting married at a beach club)\u00a0and it's not going to look empty, I just am not spending the money on flowers or candles or for our ceremony d\u00e9cor like other women are... Not that anything is wrong with spending money on those things though!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyone else similar? LOL It would make me feel better!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lcboyko@ualberta.ca","IpAddress":"23.17.180.191","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1304947091,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239790.jpg?_r=1406921722","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mrsktobe","Id":239790,"Name":"Mrsktobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.114.98.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76866,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2115e603ecf243c981c3464be7b4736e","RawContent":"simple is perfect!!! I didn&#039;t do a whole lot, just wanted the beautiful setting (and our love for each other) to shine more than any decorations. I couldn&#039;t justify spending tons of $$ on flowers, centerpieces, place settings, lavish entertainment, etc.\n\nAnd honestly none of that stuff really matters. Do what makes YOU happy. It&#039;ll be beautiful and you&#039;ll have an amazing celebration that you&#039;ll remember for the rest of your life.\n\n[quote name=\"lcboyko\" post=\"1844720\" timestamp=\"1397673357\"]\nHi Ladies!\n\nHappy Wednesday :)\n\nI just wanted to see if there was any other ladies on here who are having a simple wedding in terms of decoration and such? I keep looking through the forum here and seeing such wonderful ideas from other ladies so I feel like maybe I should do more?\n\nI know every bride is different and it&#039;s just not me to spend tons of money on d\u00e9cor. Don&#039;t get me wrong, I am bringing down things for the tables and for the card table and lighting (Getting married at a beach club) and it&#039;s not going to look empty, I just am not spending the money on flowers or candles or for our ceremony d\u00e9cor like other women are... Not that anything is wrong with spending money on those things though!\n\nAnyone else similar? LOL It would make me feel better![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1844725,"PostDate":1397649003,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>simple is perfect!!! I didn't do a whole lot, just wanted the beautiful setting (and our love for each other) to shine more than any decorations. I couldn't justify spending tons of $$ on flowers, centerpieces, place settings, lavish entertainment, etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And honestly none of that stuff really matters. Do what makes YOU happy. It'll be beautiful and you'll have an amazing celebration that you'll remember for the rest of your life.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lcboyko, on 16 April 2014 - 11:35 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Wednesday <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just wanted to see if there was any other ladies on here who are having a simple wedding in terms of decoration and such? I keep looking through the forum here and seeing such wonderful ideas from other ladies so I feel like maybe I should do more?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know\u00a0every bride is different and it's just not me to spend tons of money on d\u00e9cor. Don't get me wrong, I am bringing down things for\u00a0the tables and for the card table and lighting (Getting married at a beach club)\u00a0and it's not going to look empty, I just am not spending the money on flowers or candles or for our ceremony d\u00e9cor like other women are... Not that anything is wrong with spending money on those things though!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyone else similar? LOL It would make me feel better!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/73076-official-el-dorado-royaleel-dorado-casitas-royale-thread\/'>Official El Dorado Royale\/El Dorado Casitas Royale Thread<\/a>\u00a0<---check here for all info about EDR\/EDCR<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'>Wright Travel Agency<\/a> <--for all your Destination Wedding needs! Contact the experts and reduce your stress.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/5182-el-dorado-royale-edr-brides-post-here\/'>El Dorado Royale Brides Thread<\/a> <---come chat with other EDR brides<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/69372-allie-hs-edr-rm-mexico-11-5-2012-planning-thread\/'>AllieH's EDR 11-5-2012 Planning Thread<\/a> <--because it was so awesome","Email":"allisonmoore817@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.20.174.181","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1309632680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241884.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AllieH","Id":241884,"Name":"AllieH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.18.213.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76866,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9439f8e31583e20e3b37b858f9c1933e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You and are similar brides then! We are spending the money on food, DJ, alcohol of course. It&#039;s not that we are being super cheap or can&#039;t afford it, I just can&#039;t justify spending hundreds to thousands of dollars on some things that I will only use for one day.  A lot of the d\u00e9cor I am bringing down I am making sure it can be used again, such as lanterns and battery powered tea lights :) If it can have a dual purpose, then I am super happy.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1844726,"PostDate":1397649259,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You and are similar brides then! We are spending the money on food, DJ, alcohol of course. It's not that we are being super cheap or can't afford it, I just can't justify spending hundreds to thousands of dollars on some things that I will only use for one day.\u00a0\u00a0A lot of the d\u00e9cor I am bringing down I am making sure it can be used again, such as lanterns and battery powered tea lights <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> If it can have a dual purpose, then I am super happy.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lcboyko@ualberta.ca","IpAddress":"23.17.180.191","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1304947091,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239790.jpg?_r=1406921722","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mrsktobe","Id":239790,"Name":"Mrsktobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.23.138","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76866,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f63669bd2472006d5126936fe552db74","RawContent":"I like to think of it as \"classic\" not simple hahaha... I will hope to have a few visually pretty components, but won&#039;t have a \"lot\" of decor. It may end up costing similar but my esthetic is more clean lines and classic look- which often comes across as minimalist. I for example, am not having ANY flowers... But will still have punches of color for sure! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1844729,"PostDate":1397649819,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I like to think of it as \"classic\" not simple hahaha... I will hope to have a few visually pretty components, but won't have a \"lot\" of decor. It may end up costing similar but my esthetic is more clean lines and classic look- which often comes across as minimalist. I for example, am not having ANY flowers... But will still have punches of color for sure! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390231408,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76866,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"89c41b53bfc1952a3099bcf836116a4d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lcboyko\" post=\"1844720\" timestamp=\"1397673357\"]\nHi Ladies!\n\nHappy Wednesday :)\n\nI just wanted to see if there was any other ladies on here who are having a simple wedding in terms of decoration and such? I keep looking through the forum here and seeing such wonderful ideas from other ladies so I feel like maybe I should do more?\n\nI know every bride is different and it&#039;s just not me to spend tons of money on d\u00e9cor. Don&#039;t get me wrong, I am bringing down things for the tables and for the card table and lighting (Getting married at a beach club) and it&#039;s not going to look empty, I just am not spending the money on flowers or candles or for our ceremony d\u00e9cor like other women are... Not that anything is wrong with spending money on those things though!\n\nAnyone else similar? LOL It would make me feel better![\/quote]I too am a simple bride....I like clean white and crisp!!!  With maybe just a few votives. I don&#039;t want the big flower arrangements.  Everyone has their own unique taste....remember this is about you and your future husband.  Do what makes you happy!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1844731,"PostDate":1397649944,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lcboyko, on 16 April 2014 - 11:35 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Wednesday <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just wanted to see if there was any other ladies on here who are having a simple wedding in terms of decoration and such? I keep looking through the forum here and seeing such wonderful ideas from other ladies so I feel like maybe I should do more?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know\u00a0every bride is different and it's just not me to spend tons of money on d\u00e9cor. Don't get me wrong, I am bringing down things for\u00a0the tables and for the card table and lighting (Getting married at a beach club)\u00a0and it's not going to look empty, I just am not spending the money on flowers or candles or for our ceremony d\u00e9cor like other women are... Not that anything is wrong with spending money on those things though!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyone else similar? LOL It would make me feel better!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I too am a simple bride....I like clean white and crisp!!!\u00a0 With maybe just a few votives. I don't want the big flower arrangements.\u00a0 Everyone has their own unique taste....remember this is about you and your future husband.\u00a0 Do what makes you happy!!!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397041322,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.84.251.95","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76866,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c01e8322546d22554a500711ddd3ddbc","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lcboyko\" post=\"1844720\" timestamp=\"1397673357\"]\nHi Ladies!\n\nHappy Wednesday :)\n\nI just wanted to see if there was any other ladies on here who are having a simple wedding in terms of decoration and such? I keep looking through the forum here and seeing such wonderful ideas from other ladies so I feel like maybe I should do more?\n\nI know every bride is different and it&#039;s just not me to spend tons of money on d\u00e9cor. Don&#039;t get me wrong, I am bringing down things for the tables and for the card table and lighting (Getting married at a beach club) and it&#039;s not going to look empty, I just am not spending the money on flowers or candles or for our ceremony d\u00e9cor like other women are... Not that anything is wrong with spending money on those things though!\n\nAnyone else similar? LOL It would make me feel better![\/quote]\nI agree with the others--you have to do what makes you happy!  Please don&#039;t do ANYTHING you don&#039;t want to do. I often look at different websites and think..oooo..that&#039;s so pretty!! But at the end of the day, I had to (with the help of my planner) figure out what MY style and what was important to me.  For example, I nixed the cake topper because I didn&#039;t really want one. I also nixed the garter and bouquet toss because I didn&#039;t want those either.  However, I wanted guests to interact, have fun with each other, and get to know us through our decor (e.g. photos).  I&#039;m not really doing flowers either--just a few rose petals scattered around the tables and some palm leaves. I&#039;m also bringing things that I can use again, such as the star lanterns and mini-chalkboards.\n\nHowever--I do think that it&#039;s worth thinking carefully about what you want to spend on lighting, given the location. From all that I&#039;ve read, it&#039;s pretty dark out there at night! ;)","Attachments":[],"Id":1844739,"PostDate":1397650448,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lcboyko, on 16 April 2014 - 11:35 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Wednesday <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just wanted to see if there was any other ladies on here who are having a simple wedding in terms of decoration and such? I keep looking through the forum here and seeing such wonderful ideas from other ladies so I feel like maybe I should do more?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know\u00a0every bride is different and it's just not me to spend tons of money on d\u00e9cor. Don't get me wrong, I am bringing down things for\u00a0the tables and for the card table and lighting (Getting married at a beach club)\u00a0and it's not going to look empty, I just am not spending the money on flowers or candles or for our ceremony d\u00e9cor like other women are... Not that anything is wrong with spending money on those things though!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyone else similar? LOL It would make me feel better!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I agree with the others--you have to do what makes you happy!\u00a0 Please don't do ANYTHING you don't want to do. I often look at different websites and think..oooo..that's so pretty!! But at the end of the day, I had to (with the help of my planner) figure out what MY style and what was important to me.\u00a0 For example, I nixed the cake topper because I didn't really want one. I also nixed the garter and bouquet toss because I didn't want those either.\u00a0 However, I wanted guests to interact, have fun with each other, and get to know us through our decor (e.g. photos).\u00a0 I'm not really doing flowers either--just a few rose petals scattered around the tables and some palm leaves. I'm also bringing things that I can use again, such as the star lanterns and mini-chalkboards.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>However--I do think that it's worth thinking carefully about what you want to spend on lighting, given the location. From all that I've read, it's pretty dark out there at night! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tiffanyandmarkwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"128.172.48.117","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1366918012,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268991.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"brownsugarbride","Id":268991,"Name":"brownsugarbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.114.98.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76866,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"367a0fd6f950e6f4bc42ab3029ac8e4e","RawContent":"Tiffany is 100% right - don&#039;t do anything you don&#039;t want to. And I mean anything.\n\nWe didn&#039;t do a bouquet or garter toss either. Or toasts. No bridal party - just wanted it to be no pressure for our guests! I really believe that&#039;s one of the benefits of doing a destination wedding - a chance to a wedding that is 100% meaningful to you as a couple\/family.\n\nShoot, my bouquet was fake (and noone really knew the difference unless I said something!). I love flowers..but justifying the cost was a whole different subject. Like some of the other brides - the photography and food were our two priorities (and resort!). We were not planning to have a DJ either, but my MIL was generous enough to get that for us as a gift.\n[quote name=\"brownsugarbride\" post=\"1844739\" timestamp=\"1397675648\"]\nI agree with the others--you have to do what makes you happy!  Please don&#039;t do ANYTHING you don&#039;t want to do. I often look at different websites and think..oooo..that&#039;s so pretty!! But at the end of the day, I had to (with the help of my planner) figure out what MY style and what was important to me.  For example, I nixed the cake topper because I didn&#039;t really want one. I also nixed the garter and bouquet toss because I didn&#039;t want those either.  However, I wanted guests to interact, have fun with each other, and get to know us through our decor (e.g. photos).  I&#039;m not really doing flowers either--just a few rose petals scattered around the tables and some palm leaves. I&#039;m also bringing things that I can use again, such as the star lanterns and mini-chalkboards.\n\nHowever--I do think that it&#039;s worth thinking carefully about what you want to spend on lighting, given the location. From all that I&#039;ve read, it&#039;s pretty dark out there at night! ;)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1844789,"PostDate":1397660450,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Tiffany is 100% right - don't do anything you don't want to. And I mean anything.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We didn't do a bouquet or garter toss either. Or toasts. No bridal party - just wanted it to be no pressure for our guests! I really believe that's one of the benefits of doing a destination wedding - a chance to a wedding that is 100% meaningful to you as a couple\/family.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Shoot, my bouquet was fake (and noone really knew the difference unless I said something!). I love flowers..but justifying the cost was a whole different subject. Like some of the other brides - the photography and food were our two priorities (and resort!). We were not planning to have a DJ either, but my MIL was generous enough to get that for us as a gift.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>brownsugarbride, on 16 April 2014 - 12:14 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I agree with the others--you have to do what makes you happy!\u00a0 Please don't do ANYTHING you don't want to do. I often look at different websites and think..oooo..that's so pretty!! But at the end of the day, I had to (with the help of my planner) figure out what MY style and what was important to me.\u00a0 For example, I nixed the cake topper because I didn't really want one. I also nixed the garter and bouquet toss because I didn't want those either.\u00a0 However, I wanted guests to interact, have fun with each other, and get to know us through our decor (e.g. photos).\u00a0 I'm not really doing flowers either--just a few rose petals scattered around the tables and some palm leaves. I'm also bringing things that I can use again, such as the star lanterns and mini-chalkboards.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>However--I do think that it's worth thinking carefully about what you want to spend on lighting, given the location. From all that I've read, it's pretty dark out there at night! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/73076-official-el-dorado-royaleel-dorado-casitas-royale-thread\/'>Official El Dorado Royale\/El Dorado Casitas Royale Thread<\/a>\u00a0<---check here for all info about EDR\/EDCR<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'>Wright Travel Agency<\/a> <--for all your Destination Wedding needs! Contact the experts and reduce your stress.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/5182-el-dorado-royale-edr-brides-post-here\/'>El Dorado Royale Brides Thread<\/a> <---come chat with other EDR brides<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/69372-allie-hs-edr-rm-mexico-11-5-2012-planning-thread\/'>AllieH's EDR 11-5-2012 Planning Thread<\/a> <--because it was so awesome","Email":"allisonmoore817@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.20.174.181","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1309632680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241884.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AllieH","Id":241884,"Name":"AllieH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.179.195.171","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76866,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c08f8f058057103cf121dc8bd5bec7a2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am also keeping things simple! I am making my own centerpieces and using fake flowers for inside the vase. They are very simple and basically will just have rose petals scattered on the table with a few votives. I can&#039;t justify spending minimum $90 a centerpiece from the resort for something that will only get used for one day. I think the view of looking at the ocean is enough decoration!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1844936,"PostDate":1397728892,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am also keeping things simple! I am making my own centerpieces and using fake flowers for inside the vase. They are very simple and basically will just have rose petals scattered on the table with a few votives. I can't justify spending minimum $90 a centerpiece from the resort for something that will only get used for one day. I think the view of looking at the ocean is enough decoration!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dianna.rubio@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.179.195.171","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370516767,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270326.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deedeelala","Id":270326,"Name":"deedeelala","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.229.104.230","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76866,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c5bac91d588470796580c268a11eb695","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Simple is timeless! It will be beautiful :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1845011,"PostDate":1397755149,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Simple is timeless! It will be beautiful <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malyna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.235.105.205","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397414822,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277580.jpg?_r=1397779480","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"malyna","Id":277580,"Name":"malyna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"97.91.185.236","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76866,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8f81af2e2e85c62b43a6faa07065996e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lcboyko\" post=\"1844720\" timestamp=\"1397673357\"]\nHi Ladies!\n\nHappy Wednesday :)\n\nI just wanted to see if there was any other ladies on here who are having a simple wedding in terms of decoration and such? I keep looking through the forum here and seeing such wonderful ideas from other ladies so I feel like maybe I should do more?\n\nI know every bride is different and it&#039;s just not me to spend tons of money on d\u00e9cor. Don&#039;t get me wrong, I am bringing down things for the tables and for the card table and lighting (Getting married at a beach club) and it&#039;s not going to look empty, I just am not spending the money on flowers or candles or for our ceremony d\u00e9cor like other women are... Not that anything is wrong with spending money on those things though!\n\nAnyone else similar? LOL It would make me feel better![\/quote]I have the same feelings, but then I find myself getting caught up wondering if it&#039;ll look to \"plain\" or \"boring.\" I am a very visual person so I am having a hard time imaging how everything will come together.","Attachments":[],"Id":1845231,"PostDate":1397913872,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lcboyko, on 16 April 2014 - 11:35 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Wednesday <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just wanted to see if there was any other ladies on here who are having a simple wedding in terms of decoration and such? I keep looking through the forum here and seeing such wonderful ideas from other ladies so I feel like maybe I should do more?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know\u00a0every bride is different and it's just not me to spend tons of money on d\u00e9cor. Don't get me wrong, I am bringing down things for\u00a0the tables and for the card table and lighting (Getting married at a beach club)\u00a0and it's not going to look empty, I just am not spending the money on flowers or candles or for our ceremony d\u00e9cor like other women are... Not that anything is wrong with spending money on those things though!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyone else similar? LOL It would make me feel better!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I have the same feelings, but then I find myself getting caught up wondering if it'll look to \"plain\" or \"boring.\" I am a very visual person so I am having a hard time imaging how everything will come together.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff6666;\">I love him & he loves me, we'll be married by the sea.<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/'>Planning\u00a0Journal<\/a>\u00a0& <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blog\/86-my-destination-wedding-blog\/'>Blog<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"tricia.d.davis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.91.185.236","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396255319,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277418.jpg?_r=1418322086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":179,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pddcmc","Id":277418,"Name":"pddcmc","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"76866","Title":"Any Other Simple Decor Brides Out There?","LastPostDate":1422229939},"Pages":{"TotalItems":38,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":2,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
