ce at the resort. I am looking for a lucky bride who would like her wedding\/portraits to be photographed &lt;strong&gt;complimentary!&lt;\/strong&gt; Please reach out to me for details.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;www.RipeResolution.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;melissa@riperesolution.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope we can connect!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Kindest,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Melissa&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892080,"PostDate":1428367627,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have an amazing opportunity for anyone getting married at HR Punta Cana between April 10-16th! I am a professional wedding and lifestyle photographer coming to shoot a conference at the resort. I am looking for a lucky bride who would like her wedding\/portraits to be photographed <strong>complimentary!<\/strong> Please reach out to me for details.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>www.RipeResolution.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>melissa@riperesolution.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope we can connect!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Kindest,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Melissa<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mlssadsouza@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.232.118.184","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391531640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/defau